messages.content:
```js
AISYS.defineGame({
  schema: 1, kit: "endless-runner",
  id: "hardware-software-runner", title: "Hardware vs Software Runner", seed: "hw-sw-01",
  theme: { preset: "neon" },

  learning: {
    subject: "Teknologi Informasi",
    concept: "Membedakan perangkat keras (hardware) dan perangkat lunak (software)",
    objectives: ["Mengelompokkan benda fisik komputer sebagai hardware dan program sebagai software"],
    misconceptions: ["Sistem operasi dianggap hardware karena sudah terpasang di komputer"],
    mode: "category",
    categories: [
      { id: "hardware", label: "Hardware", color: "#00E5FF" },
      { id: "software", label: "Software", color: "#FF3DDB" }
    ],
    items: [
      { id: "monitor",   label: "Monitor",            category: "hardware", explain: "Perangkat output fisik yang menampilkan gambar di layar." },
      { id: "keyboard",  label: "Keyboard",           category: "hardware", explain: "Alat input fisik berisi tombol untuk mengetik." },
      { id: "mouse",     label: "Mouse",              category: "hardware", explain: "Alat penunjuk fisik untuk menggerakkan kursor." },
      { id: "printer",   label: "Printer",            category: "hardware", explain: "Perangkat fisik yang mencetak dokumen ke kertas." },
      { id: "cpu",       label: "CPU",                category: "hardware", explain: "Chip pemroses fisik yang menjalankan instruksi." },
      { id: "sistem-operasi", label: "Sistem operasi", category: "software", explain: "Program utama pengelola hardware; berupa kode, bukan benda fisik." },
      { id: "pengolah-kata",  label: "Aplikasi pengolah kata", category: "software", explain: "Program untuk menulis dan mengedit dokumen." },
      { id: "browser",   label: "Browser",            category: "software", explain: "Program untuk membuka dan menjelajah halaman web." },
      { id: "antivirus", label: "Antivirus",          category: "software", explain: "Program yang mendeteksi dan menghapus malware." },
      { id: "driver",    label: "Driver",             category: "software", explain: "Program penghubung agar hardware dikenali sistem." }
    ],
    target: { rotateAfterCorrect: 5, bias: 0.5 }
  },

  player: { x: 220, w: 44, h: 56, gravity: 2400, jumpVelocity: 900, lives: 5, invulnerableSec: 1.2 },
  world:  { groundY: 600, speed: 300, maxSpeed: 600, accel: 4 },

  spawner: {
    interval: [0.9, 1.5],
    table: [
      { type: "hazard", id: "kabel",   w: 90, h: 40, weight: 3 },
      { type: "hazard", id: "komponen", w: 70, h: 48, weight: 2 },
      { type: "item", weight: 5, heights: ["ground", "mid", "high"] }
    ]
  },

  rules: {
    perSecond: 5,
    correct: { score: 50, sfx: "coin" },
    wrong:   { score: -20, sfx: "hit", showExplain: true },
    hazard:  { lives: -1, sfx: "hit", shake: 8 },
    combo:   { step: 5, max: 4 },
    difficulty: { everySec: 20, speed: 20 }
  }
});
// END_OF_MANIFEST
```

Game **Hardware vs Software Runner** adalah endless runner edukasi bertema Neon di mana pemain memilah item hardware dan software sesuai target di layar. Asumsi penting: item "Sistem operasi" sengaja dimasukkan sebagai software untuk meluruskan miskonsepsi yang Anda pilih.
